      "content": "thanks. but it feels less like a \"need to find meaning\" and more like a total system failure. like the battery is just dead. i keep trying to \"recharge\" by sleeping or taking weekends off, but it doesn't change the fact that when i wake up, i'm still just this hollow thing waiting for the next meeting. i feel like i'm just playing a part in a movie that went on way too long. everything just feels so heavy and pointless.",
